Perdón or con permiso? Most learners mix them up 🙏
Perdón = oops, my bad. Con permiso = let me get past. Lo siento = I'm truly sorry.

Today's phrases:
• perdón = sorry (oops)
• con permiso = excuse me (to pass)
• no pasa nada = no worries

